	(descr "Qorvo DWM3001C UWB module, 48 castellated pads, body 19.13 x 27.1 x 3.2 mm. Pad geometry taken from Qorvo's own Altium footprint (DWM3001C.IntLib, posted by Qorvo staff in forum.qorvo.com/t/dwm3001c-footprint-and-step-file/12741, file dated 2023-03-09): pads 2.54 x 0.75 mm, 1.00 mm pitch, pins 1-17 left edge top-to-bottom, 18-31 bottom edge left-to-right, 32-48 right edge bottom-to-top. Cross-checked against DWM3001C Data Sheet Rev B (May 2022) Figure 5: 16.27 mm inner column gap, 0.75 mm pad width, 1.00 mm bottom pitch, 3.10 mm last bottom pad to right edge, 19.10 mm land width. Origin = body centre. The antenna end (top) must NOT have ground copper or components under or beside it: see Fig 5 NON-GROUND region.")
